    "title": "AI-driven cashback-to-mortgage app Sprive raises $10 million",
    "summary": "Mortgage overpayment app Sprive has closed a $10m Series A funding round.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://www.finextra.com/newsarticle/48437/ai-driven-cashback-to-mortgage-app-sprive-raises-10-million?utm_medium=rssfinextra&utm_source=finextrafeed",
