    "title": "Man Sues Chase After Bank Freezes Account Over $12,000 Zelle Transfer: Report",
    "summary": "A Pennsylvania man sued JPMorgan Chase after the bank froze his account and withheld nearly $12,000 despite affidavits saying the Zelle transfers were authorized.\nThe post Man Sues Chase After Bank Freezes Account Over $12,000 Zelle Transfer: Report appeared first on The Daily Hodl.",
    "hasSummary": true,
